@page
@model PersonalTools.Pages.CookiesModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Cookies"; }

<div class="container px-3 px-lg-4"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-12 col-lg-8">
    <p class="eyebrow">Last updated: 2 September 2026</p><h1 class="page-title">Cookies and browser storage</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle section-spacing">Clear information and direct control over storage used by Personal Tools and Case Tycoon.</p>
    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5">
        <section class="mb-4"><h2 class="h5 fw-semibold">Your choices</h2><p class="small-muted">Necessary storage provides sign-in, security, requested account persistence and remembers your privacy choice. It cannot be disabled through this control because the requested service would not work correctly. Optional preference storage remembers interface choices such as theme, layout, sound and the last selected game view. It is used only after you choose “Accept all”.</p><button class="btn btn-outline-warning" id="openCookiePreferences" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-sliders me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Review cookie choices</button></section>
        <section class="mb-4"><h2 class="h5 fw-semibold">Necessary cookies and storage</h2><p class="small-muted">These are first-party and are not used for advertising, analytics or cross-site tracking.</p><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table align-middle mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Storage</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody id="cookieTableRows"></tbody></table></div></section>
        <section class="mb-4"><h2 class="h5 fw-semibold">Optional browser storage</h2><p class="small-muted mb-0">With permission, local storage remembers appearance, navigation, Case Tycoon sound and display selections, battle catalogue layout, Notes layout and CS Match Tracker views and filters. This information remains on your device and is not used to track you across websites. Choosing Necessary only or Deny optional clears Personal Tools local storage and prevents further optional writes. You can still use the service.</p></section>
        <section class="mb-4"><h2 class="h5 fw-semibold">Session storage</h2><p class="small-muted mb-0">Short-lived session storage may hold transient interface state, such as a notification during navigation or a temporary display option. It is removed when the browser session ends and is used only to deliver the interaction you requested.</p></section>
        <section><h2 class="h5 fw-semibold">No tracking</h2><p class="small-muted mb-0">The service currently uses no analytics cookies, advertising cookies, tracking pixels or cross-site behavioural profiling. If that changes, optional technology will remain disabled until an appropriate choice is made and this notice will be updated.</p></section>
    </div></div>
</div></div></div>
@section Scripts { <script src="~/js/pages/page-cookies.js" asp-append-version="true"></script> }
